      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Assessment of pain in sickle cell disease is briefly described and a case of a 32-year-old Nigerian woman who had sickle cell pain is presented. The management and outcomes of her care in the UK are described and commentaries are presented on this case of sickle cell pain by specialists from Spain and The Netherlands."},
